    "ticket_id": "T-6014",
    "status": "pending_approval",
    "note": "Request: ap-payments-approve (sensitive) for E3401. Manager (APR-3120, E3402) and owner (APR-3121, E2104) approvals are valid. However E3401 holds ap-payments-submit, which conflicts_with ap-payments-approve (SoD). Not added. Requested sod_exception from Security (E1020), APR-4001, pending. No groups removed."
